+Bots only join rooms selected for them by default. Enable **Add to all open rooms**
+to add a bot to every current and future open room. Set its optional **Webhook URL**
+to receive a JSON callback whenever someone mentions it or first adds it to a
+room. Direct conversations do not send this callback. The webhook is delivered
+in a background job. A `200` response with a `text/plain` or
+`text/html` content type is posted as the bot; a `204` response posts nothing.
+Bots can also use the `reply_to` URL in the callback to post later.
 
